  "scenes": [
    {
      "narration": "Starting a legal business is cheaper than most people think, in some states. In others, the fees quietly stack up. Let's map it.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "hook",
          "art": "building",
          "props": [
            "coin",
            "home"
          ],
          "lines": [
            "Starting a biz,",
            "by state."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s1"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Just to start and keep a company legal runs from about forty dollars a year to over eight hundred.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "stat",
          "art": "building",
          "big": "$40 vs $800+",
          "label": "cheapest vs priciest state",
          "props": [
            "coin",
            "fire"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s2"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Incorporation is the legal act of forming a company.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-incorp",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · incorporation"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s3"
    },
    {
      "narration": "The point isn't the paperwork. It's the legal wall an LLC puts between the business and your personal assets.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "truth",
          "art": "building",
          "kicker": "why bother",
          "line": "A legal wall",
          "sub": "it protects your house"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s4"
    },
    {
      "narration": "As a sole proprietor, your own home is on the line.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-sole",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · sole proprietorship"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s5"
    },
    {
      "narration": "And most US businesses are tiny, around seventy-five percent have no employees at all.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "stat",
          "art": "building",
          "big": "75%",
          "label": "of US businesses are solo",
          "props": [
            "home",
            "coin"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s6"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Many also need a local business license on top.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-license",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · business license"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s7"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Recurring fees just to stay legal can run seven hundred to a thousand dollars a year.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "flash",
          "bg": "ink",
          "line": "$700–1,000/yr",
          "props": [
            "coin",
            "clock"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s8"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Skip that legal wall, and a single lawsuit can reach straight into your personal savings.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "flash",
          "bg": "red",
          "line": "One lawsuit away",
          "props": [
            "home",
            "x"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s9"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Even the smallest startup benefits from that protection.",
